    <string name="help_intro">Kaliya soo deji fiidyow dadweyne, oo aan DRM ahayn oo aad fasax u haysato inaad kaydiso.</string>
    <string name="help_step_url_title">1. Ka hel cinwaanka shabakadda</string>
    <string name="help_step_url_description">Ku dheji ciwaanka bogga fiidyowga guriga, hel fiidiyowyada, oo dooro waxa la kaydinayo.</string>
    <string name="help_step_share_title">2. La wadaag Chrome ama X</string>
    <string name="help_step_share_description">Ka dooro Dambom liiska wadaaga abka kale, xaqiiji xidhiidhka, oo bilow inaad hesho muuqaalo.</string>
    <string name="help_step_web_title">3. Ka baadho gudaha app-ka</string>
    <string name="help_step_web_description">Fur tabs shabakado badan, daar fiidyaha bogga hadda, dabadeed taabo Fiidiyowga.</string>
    <string name="help_step_download_title">4. Maamul soo dejinta</string>
    <string name="help_step_download_description">Hubi horumarka safka oo hakad, dib u bilow, jooji, ama isku day soo dejin kasta.</string>
    <string name="help_step_library_title">5. Ka daawo maktabadda</string>
    <string name="help_step_library_description">Markaad baxdo iyadoo fiidyow maxalli ah oo dhammaystiran uu ciyaarayo shaashad buuxda, dib-u-ciyaartu waxay ku sii socotaa PiP aaladaha la taageeray. Fiidiyowyada khadka tooska ah, hakadka ku jira ama maqan si toos ah uma galaan, mana jiraan adeeg dib-u-ciyaarid hore oo la bixiyay.</string>
    <string name="settings_shared_auto_download">Si toos ah u soo deji xiriiriyeyaasha la wadaago</string>
    <string name="settings_shared_auto_description">Soo deji xiriiriyeyaasha la wadaago oo keliya tayada aad dooratay. Dooro fiidiyowyada marka hore marka dhowr la helo.</string>
